{%- comment -%}
  One panel of the Signature Products focus rail — see sections/caviera-signature-products.liquid.
  Params: product (required), index (0-based integer), is_first (bool)

  Reuses the shared `product-card` snippet for the actual product display (Phase 25: one
  product-card system, never a duplicate one per homepage section) — this snippet only adds the
  thumbnail/tab chrome and the swap target around it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<a
  href="{{ product.url }}"
  class="caviera-signature-products__thumb{% if is_first %} is-active{% endif %}"
  data-signature-thumb
  role="tab"
  id="CavieraSignatureTab-{{ index }}"
  aria-selected="{% if is_first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
  aria-controls="CavieraSignatureFocus"
  tabindex="{% if is_first %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
>
  {%- if product.featured_image -%}
    <img
      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 }}"
      srcset="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 80 }} 80w, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 }} 160w"
      sizes="80px"
      width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  {%- endif -%}
  <span class="caviera-signature-products__thumb-title">{{ product.title }}</span>
</a>
{%- comment -%}
  Every panel — including the first — gets a <template>, so data-signature-panel indices always
  line up 1:1 with data-signature-thumb indices for the JS swap (the first product is ALSO
  rendered directly and visibly by the section itself, so the section works with no JavaScript at
  all; this template is simply unused until a visitor navigates away from it and back).
{%- endcomment -%}
<template data-signature-panel>
  {%- render 'product-card', product: product, image_ratio: 'portrait' -%}
</template>
